meta {
  name: The active account's tree
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{bffUrl}}/api/v1/tree
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  What the cockpit's sidebar draws, in a single response.

  Fetching workspaces and then one ListProjects per workspace would make the
  navigation flicker over N requests — aggregating is precisely the BFF's job.

  A project WITHOUT a board returns `task_manager: null`, not a link of empty
  fields: a zeroed link would make the screen show "a board is configured" where
  there is no board at all.
}
